Today is a beautiful morning.
I am standing at the BEST bus stop.
Today I need to get to the metro station.
So I am waiting for the bus here.
Many vehicles are going on the road.
After some time, a red-colored bus arrives.
It is a familiar bus.
It comes near the stop.
The speed of the bus becomes slow.
The bus stops here at the stop.
Its doors open.
Some people alight from the bus.
Then I step forward.
I confidently board the bus.
I firmly hold the handrail for balance.
Now I am inside the bus.
Traveling by bus in Mumbai is easy.
The bus moves forward again.
